# Minecraft Bedrock Mobile Server

This repo is a simple starter project for running a Bedrock-compatible Minecraft server on Android using PocketMine-MP in Termux.

## Files

- `scripts/install-server.sh`
- `scripts/start-server.sh`
- `scripts/stop-server.sh`
- `config/server.properties.example`
- `config/pocketmine.yml.example`

## Ignore generated runtime files

PocketMine-MP generates live server files (world data, logs, plugins, etc.) that should not be committed.

```gitignore
# Local environment
.env
*.log

# PocketMine runtime files
server.properties
pocketmine.yml
plugins/
worlds/
logs/
bin/

# OS/editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```
